  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "19. Attached Units",
    "ruleNumber": "19.04",
    "order": 226,
    "anchor": "19.04",
    "summary": "A rule given to one specific model, such as through an Enhancement or wargear, affects only that model, even inside an **Attached unit**. A rule given to a unit or its models affects every model in the Attached unit until its source is **destroyed**:\n\n- Leader, support or bodyguard unit: until the last model of that unit is destroyed.\n- A single model, such as one carrying an Enhancement or wargear: until that model is destroyed.\n\nIf that last model falls to an attack, the effect holds until the attacker's unit finishes all its attacks in that [Attack Sequence](vsdata:core-rule/attack-sequence).\n\nA leader or support unit that began the battle attached keeps its own while-leading abilities after its bodyguard unit is destroyed.",
